    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like i'm overreacting... it's not red or anything, just a bit puffy. i'm sure it's fine. actually, my friend said i could just take some extra ibuprofen to help with the tightness? do u think if i just take a couple more of those it'll help the swelling go down so i don't have to call the clinic?",
