      "content": "While ibuprofen can help with general pain and inflammation, adjusting your dosage without professional guidance is risky, especially after surgery. It's best to stick to the exact medication and dosage instructions provided by your surgeon. If you are concerned, a quick check-in with the clinic staff is much less of a hassle than dealing with a complication later.",
      "source": "target",
